{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Wwh74DezT3ChEnJMcqpHrm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"tail-384 确认 sharp phase transition + budget curve 4 模型一致 → 3 个 Core Claims 全强度成立，phase transition 作为额外 bonus finding\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"tail-384 在 4 模型上均 ≤82%（接近 tail-256 水平），phase transition 集中在 384→512 token 窗口\"\n      - \"4 模型 budget curve 呈一致阶梯形态：plateau(≤384) → jump(384-512) → saturation(≥512)\"\n      - \"CodeLlama tail-2048 collapse 可归因于 full-sequence loss dilution + tokenizer 交互（tail-1024=98.2% 排除模型缺陷）\"\n      - \"nomarker ~2pp gap 被接受为 minor shortcut（97.65% 证明 semantic learning 为主）\"\n      - \"4 模型 × 3 家族 × 2 scale 被认为对 empirical study 足够\"\n    number_ranges:\n      phase_transition_sharpness: [0.80, 1.00]   # 1-(t384-t256)/(t512-t256)，高=sharp，best≥median≥worst\n      budget_curve_consistent_models: [3, 4]       # /4，高=好\n      tail384_cross_model_std_pp: [0.5, 3.0]      # 低=模型间一致=好\n      contribution_strength: [3.0, 3.0]            # /3，3 个 claims 全强度\n      emnlp_main_probability: [0.50, 0.65]\n      expected_reviewer_avg: [3.5, 4.0]            # ARR 1-5\n    narrative_direction: \"原始 framing 无需调整。三个独立 contribution: (1) Exception dominance — 4 模型 multi-seed, 最简信号最 robust, scale invariance (1.5B=7B=13B=99.83%) 进 abstract; (2) Information density with phase transition — tail-512 阶梯跃迁 + label_only 26/74 分解 + tail≫head (tail-512 ~94% vs head-2048 ~79%); (3) Two-tier diagnostic hierarchy — Tier 1 near-perfect + calibration ECE 63x gap。Phase transition 独立小节写入 Results，label_only_loss 支撑 Claim 2 因果链。\"\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"tail-384 显示 gradual transition（非 sharp）；budget curve 趋势一致但无明确拐点 → Claim 2 drop phase transition，改 diminishing returns 叙事\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"tail-384 在多数模型上 83-89%（256→512 中段），transition 是 smooth gradient 非 sharp boundary\"\n      - \"4 模型 budget curve 单调趋势一致但不存在共同拐点，形状类似 log curve\"\n      - \"cross-seed variance 适中（σ 1-3pp at tail-512），noise 不否定趋势但削弱 point estimate 精度\"\n      - \"审稿人对 single-task scope 有保留但接受 depth-over-breadth argument\"\n      - \"label_only_loss 26/74 分解本身 clean，是 Claim 2 的独立支撑（不依赖 budget curve 形态）\"\n    number_ranges:\n      phase_transition_sharpness: [0.35, 0.65]\n      budget_curve_consistent_models: [2, 3]\n      tail384_cross_model_std_pp: [2.0, 5.0]\n      contribution_strength: [2.5, 2.5]            # Claims 1+3 全强度, Claim 2 部分降级\n      emnlp_main_probability: [0.30, 0.45]\n      expected_reviewer_avg: [3.0, 3.5]\n    narrative_direction: \"Claim 2 从 'phase transition in trace informativeness' 改为 'diagnostic signal concentrates in trace tail with diminishing returns; information density — not gradient dilution — is the primary bottleneck'。Budget curve 降为 supporting figure（不再 standalone finding），label_only 26/74 分解升为 Claim 2 sole quantitative evidence。补偿措施: (a) tail≫head 对比（tail-512 ~94% vs head-2048 ~79%, Δ≈15pp）作为 information locality 的 strong evidence; (b) exception_only scale invariance 提升至更高叙事位置; (c) 补做 cross-model calibration (plan_019, 1h) + error analysis (plan_018, 0h) 增加独立 evidence 维度。仍冲 Main，Findings 作 fallback。\"\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"budget curve 4 模型间模式分裂（部分单调/部分非单调/CodeLlama 多点 anomaly）→ budget curve 作为 contribution 失效，论文需 reframe angle 但不降级目标\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"tail-384 跨模型离散度大（std >5pp）：部分 sharp、部分 gradual、部分非单调\"\n      - \"budget curve 形态 model-specific，无法提炼 universal trace-length pattern\"\n      - \"CodeLlama 多个 length 点异常引发审稿人对训练 pipeline 健壮性质疑\"\n      - \"审稿人强烈要求 task/dataset diversity，4 模型不被视为弥补 single-task 的充分条件\"\n      - \"exception_only 99.83% × 4 模型 + component ablation + calibration 仍为 solid anchor\"\n    number_ranges:\n      phase_transition_sharpness: [0.00, 0.40]     # 无一致 pattern 或部分模型反转\n      budget_curve_consistent_models: [1, 2]\n      tail384_cross_model_std_pp: [5.0, 12.0]\n      contribution_strength: [2.0, 2.0]            # Claims 1+3 survive, Claim 2 大幅缩水\n      emnlp_main_probability: [0.15, 0.30]\n      expected_reviewer_avg: [2.5, 3.0]\n    narrative_direction: \"Reframe angle，不降级 venue。新 headline: 'Exception events as the only universally robust trace signal for verdict prediction — all other trace components are model-dependent.' Budget curve 从 Results 移至 Appendix（supplementary, 不支撑任何 claim）。重心调整: (1) Exception dominance 升级为唯一 headline contribution，强调 universality — 4 models × 3 families × 2 scales × multi-seed，唯一在所有 setting 下 consistent; (2) Claim 2 精简为 label_only 单一实验（gradient dilution +4.5pp minor vs information overload +13pp major），不引用 budget curve; (3) Two-tier hierarchy + calibration 作 supporting contribution。额外弹药: zero-shot vs SFT (SFT +9pp over few-shot) 凸显 practical value; irreducible error analysis (GeneratorExit) 凸显 analytical depth; data duplication as representation signature 凸显 methodological rigor。竞争 Main 靠 'unexpected simplicity wins' 的 empirical discovery narrative + analytical thoroughness。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":53085,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":18,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b2f9c702-d51c-4d47-8286-7a931d12974b","uuid":"f9326706-446f-431b-a526-b3fd1ba9bab4"}
